cosign.key
MOK.priv
_build_*
output
_build-*/**
.claude/
__pycache__/
# Generated files nothing reviews: rendered disk configs, local image
# exports, temporary build state. containerfiles/ is the exception and is
# tracked, because the expanded build is what a change to a module has to
# be reviewed as.
build/
# Out-of-tree modules, fetched from the pins in the image files. Inside
# the module tree because the ctx stage copies it; the pin is what is
# reviewed, and the expanded layer shows up in the generated Containerfile.
modules/.remote/
# Compiled host tooling
tools/*/target/
